          "angle": 210
        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "title": "Live-verify the whole panel",
        "body": "Open the new App Settings panel with no graph open (confirm it doesn't require one). Adjust mouse sensitivity and confirm wheel-zoom responsiveness actually changes. Confirm uiDensity, watermark, and focus-indicator settings still work identically to before the migration. Confirm Document Properties no longer shows the moved settings. Run against a real browser, not just unit tests, since this whole task line started from a live \"it feels sluggish\" report.",
        "status": "todo",
        "owner": "",
        "priority": "high",
        "estimateHours": "",
        "acceptanceCriteria": [
          "Live click-through confirms the panel works standalone",
          "Live scroll/zoom confirms sensitivity adjustment has a real, felt effect",
          "Every migrated setting is confirmed working post-move, not just present",
          "Full test suite stays green"
        ],
        "classRef": "github://twilite-zone/public/library/classes/nodes/task-planning/task.node-class.node"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "asp-question",
      "type": "open-question",
